  "scope": "At absolute turning m >= 2, initial excess LB-(2 pi m)^2 <= pi^2/4 yields both the closed two-time physical disk and the fixed time-zero disk for the one-sided classical flow. The converse necessary condition for two strictly separated traces is strict. The Migration project verifies the spatial estimates, material energy propagation, conservation of winding and the initial-time limit."
